Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.87,0:00:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why him, of all people?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.27,0:00:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was Father thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.27,0:00:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giving a man of unknown\Nlineage the Black Blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.47,0:00:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was from back when\NFather was an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.51,0:00:19.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He and the Sovereign\NSix had pushed deep into
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.99,0:00:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the darkest corner of\Nthe Dungeon of the Lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.75,0:00:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a long and dangerous quest that,\Nupon exiting, yielded a prime dungeon relic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.65,0:00:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Blade is the most powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.99,0:00:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Made of an unknown material\Nharder than mithril
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.91,0:00:36.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or a calcium or even\Nmonometal no matter the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.97,0:00:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,technique or skill used\Nnothing can cause even
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.89,0:00:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a scratch upon it it\Nhas become known as the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.39,0:00:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unbreakable blade the\Nbiggest question is given
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.61,0:00:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,its resilience how could\Nsuch an indestructible
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.21,0:00:54.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,material gotten so\Nbeaten up that sword has
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.39,0:00:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,value beyond that of a\Nweapon how could he just?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.43,0:01:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let such a thing go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.81,0:01:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm thinking about this wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.79,0:01:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father has also noticed the sense of
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.13,0:01:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unrest hanging over the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.73,0:01:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In all likelihood, he is\Nputting his faith in that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.63,0:01:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one who defeated a rampaging\Nminotaur and saved Lin's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.47,0:01:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might very well be\Nour secret weapon for
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.07,0:01:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whatever is sure to happen in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.27,0:01:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait, Lynn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.77,0:01:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you be seen out here in public? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.43,0:01:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First and foremost, I am an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.91,0:01:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, well, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.82,0:01:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking we should go\Nto the guild after we eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.71,0:01:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds terrific, instructor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.63,0:01:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.01,0:01:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really not the type\Nof guy who should be
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.97,0:01:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,considered capable enough\Nof instructing Anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.15,0:01:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.06,0:01:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did everything get so complicated?\NAnd she just follows me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.63,0:02:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everywhere all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.13,0:02:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I get some real work from the guild,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.99,0:02:07.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she'll finally be able to\Ngrasp how clueless I am
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.77,0:02:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out there and drop this\Nwhole instructor nonsense?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.29,0:02:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope that you can find.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.31,0:02:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a befitting task soon, Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.89,0:02:15.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.31,0:02:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't be able to get\Nthe power of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.23,0:02:49.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I find?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.83,0:02:51.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I find?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.93,0:02:54.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't be able to follow my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.07,0:02:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't be able to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.98,0:03:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's the end of the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.31,0:03:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't be able to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.95,0:03:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.35,0:03:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.75,0:03:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.35,0:03:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.37,0:04:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, it's kind of\Ndifficult to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.25,0:04:16.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, one of our rules is not sticking\Nyour nose where it doesn't belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.59,0:04:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget I asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.71,0:04:20.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I was hoping he'd give me some advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.69,0:04:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what brings you in today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.61,0:04:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looking for work?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.79,0:04:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.15,0:04:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One that two people can do, if possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.25,0:04:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A two-person job, huh? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.73,0:04:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if I remember correctly,\Nyou're Silver B-Ring, right? Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.39,0:04:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you two form a party together,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.99,0:04:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can take on the goblin hunting\Njob in the outskirts of the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.15,0:04:45.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.51,0:04:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A goblin hunting job?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.19,0:04:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goblins are the monsters\Nthat adventurers all over
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.61,0:04:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the world fight to put\Ntheir skills to the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.49,0:04:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, sir, can we really take\Non an adventure like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.87,0:04:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.78,0:05:01.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lynn can accept silver tasks\Nlike this all on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.49,0:05:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But bringing along a partner like you with
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.57,0:05:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a lower rank than hers is a big liability.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.37,0:05:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Normally, the job will drop\Ndown a rank or two, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.83,0:05:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.81,0:05:13.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A quest outside the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.63,0:05:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.77,0:05:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This means I'm completely taking\Nadvantage of Lin's adventurer rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.25,0:05:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And let's be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.71,0:05:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up until now, all I've wanted\Nis for her to go back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.47,0:05:29.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She sees right through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.13,0:05:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm such a scumbag, and she knows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.75,0:05:35.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, she does still want to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.89,0:05:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.19,0:05:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, what's wrong, Instructor?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.29,0:05:40.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.69,0:05:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure you're okay with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.17,0:05:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, as it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.69,0:05:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm relying solely on your rank to\Ntake on this goblin hunting job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.05,0:05:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm okay with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.95,0:05:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there's anything I can do for\Nyou, just say the word, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.85,0:05:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.43,0:06:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do feel kind of bad for\Nusing her status to get ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.73,0:06:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But hey, one of my lifelong\Ndreams is finally coming true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.89,0:06:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we're heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.75,0:06:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I haven't told you where\Nyou're going or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.39,0:06:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.95,0:06:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you want to take it anyway, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.95,0:06:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.67,0:06:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, don't go nuts out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.55,0:06:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A low threat level doesn't mean\Nthat it's easy-peasy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.29,0:06:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.35,0:06:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm well aware of my limitations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.15,0:06:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to this area here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.87,0:06:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only report what you catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.01,0:06:37.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the Forest of Beasts. Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.87,0:06:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The right ear will be the\Nproof of your success.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.55,0:06:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't be getting paid without it,\Nso be sure to bring it back. Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.07,0:06:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring back the right ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.63,0:06:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So there have been reports of their\Nnumbers diminishing quite a bit lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.39,0:06:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't come across one, then go\Nahead and pick some medicinal herbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.25,0:06:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.16,0:06:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now go on, get on with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.59,0:06:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm serious, don't get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.11,0:07:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.91,0:07:08.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.91,0:07:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Adventure onward! Right! Sure thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.09,0:07:29.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we are in the Forest of the Beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.55,0:07:32.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The trees are getting\Npretty dense, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.35,0:07:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are different types of plants than\Nwhat we see in the southern forests.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.25,0:07:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gargantuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.65,0:07:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ecological system here is very unique.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.43,0:07:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're not kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.21,0:07:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lynn, what kind of\Ncreatures are goblins? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.91,0:07:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'd like to at least\Nhear about them beforehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.13,0:07:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.69,0:08:00.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Normally they hunt small animals as\Nprey and eat the fruits off trees,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.43,0:08:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they've been attacking\Nhumans for sustenance lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.19,0:08:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we leave them be, their numbers grow\Ntoo large which leads to a food shortage,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.99,0:08:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which in turn would overflow\Ninto human villages.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.47,0:08:13.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why adventurers\Nare regularly dispatched
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.67,0:08:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to hunt them and control their numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.69,0:08:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Control them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.65,0:08:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The health of the ecological\Nsystem of the forest
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.29,0:08:22.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,actually depends on whether\Nor not there are goblins,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.09,0:08:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means we don't want to\Nhunt them to extinction either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.77,0:08:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, this forest has rare flora and\Nfauna that are not found in other places.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.77,0:08:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's sometimes used for training, for\Nbeginner adventurers to forage and hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.11,0:08:37.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.75,0:08:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only does Lin have the skills,\Nshe knows all sorts of... stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.29,0:08:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I possibly teach this person?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.41,0:09:04.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got anything afraid?\NNot none here either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.95,0:09:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's strange right\Nunder normal circumstances
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.77,0:09:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we would have encountered\Na few of them already
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.85,0:09:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i suppose the rumors\Nabout the goblin numbers
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.93,0:09:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dwindling are true i'm\Ngetting something from
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.47,0:09:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a creature to the\Nnorthwest i'll pinpoint its
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.25,0:09:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,location, so we found one.\NYes, it shouldn't take
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.13,0:09:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too much time to get\Nthere let's go take a look
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.95,0:09:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it keeps getting darker and darker there\Nare some extremely old trees in this area
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.99,0:09:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,makes it hard for the sun to shine through
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.23,0:09:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,goblins are known to\Nprefer a place like this
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.83,0:09:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of course they would huh what's wrong the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.71,0:09:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,presence of a monster\Nwas right up ahead but
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.11,0:09:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all of a sudden it disappeared it's gone
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.07,0:09:59.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yes monsters are living\Nbeings like us right
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.31,0:10:05.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you think that they can maybe just die\Nfrom illness or old age um yeah i guess
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.27,0:10:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that could be a possibility it was around
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.81,0:10:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here i don't see
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.11,0:10:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,anything yeah me neither
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.03,0:10:24.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.39,0:10:30.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.65,0:10:39.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm covered!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.91,0:10:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.61,0:10:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.75,0:10:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a goblin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.93,0:10:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A big one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.53,0:11:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's a goblin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.17,0:11:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's way bigger than I imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.65,0:11:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're said to be one of the weakest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.57,0:11:08.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's a huge difference in hearing\Nabout it and meeting one face to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.05,0:11:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gnarly beast has\Nall the calling cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.09,0:11:14.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Green skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.31,0:11:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walking on two legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.93,0:11:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,piercing glowing eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.03,0:11:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they use tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.89,0:11:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bet all you higher-ranked adventurers\Nhandle these guys like they're nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.31,0:11:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.22,0:11:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so she's freaked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.35,0:11:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She may be blessed with abilities, but she\Nhas very little actual combat experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.83,0:11:42.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need to be frightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.65,0:11:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're only up against a goblin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.17,0:11:49.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.99,0:11:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But worry about that later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.49,0:11:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.93,0:11:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.84,0:11:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.47,0:12:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uncovered!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.87,0:12:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it. Can't be no\Nit's the goblin emperor
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.73,0:12:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a subspecies of the goblin king considered
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.65,0:12:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an Extreme threat the\Ngoblin emperor is a beast
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.85,0:12:31.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Created from genetic\Nmanipulation by mankind. In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.73,0:12:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the deviant research that brought forth\Nthis forbidden knowledge is now banned!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.33,0:12:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On top of that, this\None eats its own kind,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.93,0:12:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ingesting their power and\Ngrowing even stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.39,0:12:41.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need to be frightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.99,0:12:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're only up against a goblin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.83,0:12:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.07,0:12:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did Nor come here because of this goblin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.67,0:12:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was so excited to take\Non this job because he
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.53,0:12:56.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wanted to eliminate a threat\Nno one else knew about!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.97,0:12:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got your back, Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.21,0:13:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.69,0:13:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.15,0:13:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.37,0:13:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.13,0:13:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.79,0:13:21.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.69,0:13:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trying to corner me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.41,0:13:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, I ain't gonna let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.43,0:13:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lynn! On it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.59,0:13:43.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Full wind cutter!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.15,0:13:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Icicle Dan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.07,0:13:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hit him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.83,0:13:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think it could be so quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.67,0:14:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.77,0:14:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor! Are you alright? Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.75,0:14:17.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perry! Perry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.61,0:14:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.99,0:14:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.77,0:14:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the wound?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.21,0:14:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goblin emperors shouldn't be\Nable to recover so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.55,0:14:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.19,0:14:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.10,0:14:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stone on its forehead!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.75,0:14:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can get that off, we can defeat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.23,0:14:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.29,0:14:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was watching how many I could handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.13,0:14:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't block them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.55,0:14:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Windblast!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.67,0:15:06.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.75,0:15:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.27,0:15:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's constantly replenishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.97,0:15:18.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,its power with the monastone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.47,0:15:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh if we keep fighting like this\Nwe're going to run out of both?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.35,0:15:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stamina and magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.35,0:15:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if your magic attacks aren't\Nable to hit him and keep him down,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.59,0:15:32.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nothing I can do is going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.31,0:15:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lin, can you aim that\Nattack at my back? Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.11,0:15:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean Wind Blast? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.51,0:15:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That move is powerful enough\Nto demolish Castle Walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.87,0:15:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't possibly want me to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.43,0:15:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.53,0:15:57.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have this to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.43,0:16:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our only chance of getting\Nout of here is to be faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.59,0:16:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.45,0:16:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go! Let her rip!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.85,0:16:12.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Full weight loss!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.43,0:16:20.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Physical enhancement!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.35,0:16:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feather steps!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.35,0:16:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Low heel!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.63,0:17:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.89,0:17:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.13,0:17:05.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.69,0:17:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lynn, can you be the one to finish it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.73,0:17:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And please don't let it suffer\Nany more than it already has.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.71,0:17:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.41,0:17:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell! Flare!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.41,0:18:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, goblin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.45,0:18:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'll refrain from any more\Ngoblin slaying for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.73,0:18:13.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was way overconfident and got\Ninto too many dangerous situations.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.43,0:18:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have to do a lot more training\Nbefore taking on the next challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.49,0:18:31.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it was a goblin emperor, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.75,0:18:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must have been quite powerful with\Nthis size mana stone it's larger than
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.39,0:18:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,normal according to the reports it was\Nseveral times the size of a goblin king!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.33,0:18:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it was the size\Nis unusual the magic
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.91,0:18:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,empire may be responsible\Nfor the event itself?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.31,0:18:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, this stone, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.05,0:18:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We think, sir, it could be a demon's\Nheart from the holy theocracy of Mithra.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.05,0:18:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is Lin?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.23,0:19:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only minor wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.49,0:19:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must have been a terribly hard battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.69,0:19:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's amazing they were able to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.03,0:19:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The monster itself hid\Nbehind a powerful seal
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.07,0:19:13.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and ambushed them in the Forest of Beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.25,0:19:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The lady believes it had\Nbeen there a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.29,0:19:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in fact, maybe even more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.75,0:19:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A few days, so this seal is one that\Nnot even the secret core can perceive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.17,0:19:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how are they transporting such a bulky
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.65,0:19:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thing all the way here in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.17,0:19:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they use summoning magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.25,0:19:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sensory network in the\Ncapital should have caught it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.43,0:19:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did nothing show up in the perimeter?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.87,0:19:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The number of goblins was decreasing,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.03,0:19:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so the Adventurer's Guild\Nrequested an investigation into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.11,0:19:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There may have been several similar\Ncases in other areas as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.69,0:19:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this report is a summary of questionable\Ninstances from the last three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.01,0:19:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well done, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.19,0:19:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Continue with the inquiry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.47,0:20:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.85,0:20:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought that the little runt from
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.99,0:20:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,way back when would\Ngrow up to slay goblins.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.61,0:20:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was so much nastier\Nthan I thought it would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.41,0:20:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Lin came in at the last moment, and\Nwe managed to get the job done no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.27,0:20:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, that's not how it went.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.67,0:20:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.77,0:20:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My very first hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.05,0:20:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.21,0:20:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may be just another quest to other\Nadventurers, but to me, this is, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.65,0:20:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.57,0:20:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.79,0:20:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Best to just watch from the\Nsidelines and let her handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.15,0:20:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I guess probably it's the wiser\Nchoice, too, eh? You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.59,0:20:41.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just grateful I got to\Nhelp her out a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.49,0:20:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea where I'd be\Nif Lin hadn't been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.25,0:20:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm the one that just\Nhelped you out, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.53,0:20:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, even goblins can still be a\Nthreat to newbies from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.19,0:20:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it was a good\Nexperience for you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.19,0:20:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly, it certainly was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.89,0:21:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until I saw one in real life, I had no\Nidea goblins were anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.37,0:21:05.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who knew about the stone on\Nits forehead being a weak point?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.59,0:21:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stone on the forehead?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.17,0:21:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.55,0:21:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, kind of a shiny reddish color.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.69,0:21:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And kind of pretty, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.93,0:21:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean a monostone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.29,0:21:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's normally buried in\Nthe heart or the throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.91,0:21:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.97,0:21:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure that was\Nreally a goblin, my boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.13,0:21:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.33,0:21:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A goblin, right? Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.43,0:21:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's what you say it is,\Ninstructor, then that is that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.39,0:21:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what anybody says. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.21,0:21:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Might have been a rare type, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.91,0:21:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's see\Nthe proof of the kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.03,0:21:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get your cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.95,0:21:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The right ear. I told you\Nto bring back the right ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.37,0:21:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no way
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.73,0:21:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,um we might have set that\Ngoblin on fire you did what
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.65,0:22:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.99,0:22:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.61,0:23:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be back.

